{"id":"tierra-de-mi-padre-tmdb-1437696","type":"MOVIE","category":"CINE","title":"Tierra de Mi Padre","overview":"En 1949, Thomas Mann, premio Nobel de Literatura, regresa por primera vez a Alemania tras el final de la guerra, acompañado por su hija Erika (actriz, escritora y piloto de rallies). A bordo de un Buick negro, emprenden un viaje duro por el país que abandonaron dieciséis años antes, cuando los nazis llegaron al poder. Desde Fráncfort (bajo control estadounidense) hasta Weimar (bajo control soviético), padre e hija atraviesan una Alemania en ruinas, ya partida en dos por la Guerra Fría.","releaseDate":"2026-10-22","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VjwmvDG5mksJBXMcmK6PudqH88.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zKoBjLggS4v22a9ZiCvmLaZrht7.jpg","genres":["Drama","Historia"],"originalLanguage":"pl","spokenLanguages":["German","English","Russian","French","Polish"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zKoBjLggS4v22a9ZiCvmLaZrht7.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sSyeRXg3posPAF8XNTHtDurR7sB.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/lPJg1bFPrVfbA9FVyHd4FOFJhPQ.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zz0J14pzfXGcQRXG1VIfmhbtQgK.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/f7plF7QuPfucWQU5DxqkgLp9gFN.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":7.3},"availability":{},"cast":[{"name":"Sandra Hüller","role":"Erika Mann","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQfKXVCPTH9KEnzHHU4QemCnlMe.jpg","personTmdbId":7152,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Hanns Zischler","role":"Thomas Mann","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5O4Dum1OuKI4RMB24xjACkL22iA.jpg","personTmdbId":169,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"August Diehl","role":"Klaus Mann","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZfdH3EXLr5OmXBtxV1zT8eYbpT.jpg","personTmdbId":6091,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Anna Madeley","role":"Betty Knox","photoUrl":"https